n光线柔和均匀，来自侧前方，塑造自然立体的面部轮廓与服装褶皱，阴影过渡细腻，无强烈对比。整体色调偏冷暖平衡，以灰蓝、粉银、米白为主，营造清雅梦幻的视觉感受。氛围静谧温柔，带有一丝日系动漫的唯美与少女心，符合亚洲审美偏好，强调含蓄与精致，避免过度暴露或欧美风格。\n\n提示词：亚洲女性，粉银长发，柔顺垂落，温柔眼神，淡妆红晕，日系动漫风格。浅灰蓝色洛丽塔连衣裙，缎带蝴蝶结，金属扣环，褶皱设计，贴合身形，展现柔和曲线。背景简约室内，米色墙面与木门，柔和虚化。中近景特写，仰拍视角，聚焦面部与服饰。光线柔和，侧前方打光，阴影细腻。色调冷暖平衡，灰蓝粉银米白主调，清雅梦幻。氛围静谧温柔，含蓄精致，日系唯美少女感，亚洲审美，无欧美风格，无裸露，服饰遮盖完整，强调优雅与细节。"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 3784, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#335", "size": [370.2869567871094, 578.1312255859375], "pos": [2796.79931640625, -301.93896484375], "id": 394, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-easy-use", "ver": "125b3a4905ac9367f7aae5c2df67e2282f0a3d37", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 22}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "links": [3816], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 3815, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [362.9278564453125, 569.5455932617188], "pos": [3174.869873046875, -297.1397705078125], "id": 392, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-custom-scripts", "ver": "f2838ed5e59de4d73cde5c98354b87a8d3200190", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.4.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"}, "order": 26}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [3831], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [1], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "text1", "link": 3837, "label": "文本_1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "text2", "link": 3838, "label": "文本_2", "type": "STR